sequenceDiagram
  actor User as Пользователь
  participant Gate as AuthGate
  participant Helper as Existing auth helpers
  participant Server as Java / Google OIDC
  User->>Gate: Login или register, Google CTA
  Gate->>Gate: Очистить пароли, pending, duplicate guard
  Gate->>Helper: login() один раз, без local submit
  alt Прямой Google
    Helper->>Server: Навигация /oauth2/authorization/guitar-mentor
  else Локальный guarded bridge
    Helper->>Server: POST start с existing CSRF
    Server-->>Helper: Allowlisted localhost beginUrl
    Helper->>Server: Existing OIDC / bound one-time ticket exchange
  end
  alt Успех
    Server-->>Helper: Прежняя сессия / one-time fragment
    Helper->>Helper: Scrub до Router, consume once
    Helper->>Server: Existing consume если bridge, затем GET /me
    Server-->>Gate: Actor либо безопасный отказ
    Gate-->>User: Private slot только при actor
  else Ошибка / отказ
    Server-->>Gate: Existing allowlisted failure marker
    Gate->>Gate: Очистить marker/pending, static safe error
    Gate-->>User: Повтор или вход по email
  end
